  Content:
  - '**Rarity:** Common

    **Suite:** Rapax

    **Memory Cost:** 0.5 GB

    **Routine
    Size:** 0.1 GB

    **Storage Cost:** 2 GB

    **Scaling:** Linear'
  - Increase all outgoing damage by +15% per stack. This includes all abilities,
    weapons, programs, status effects, and accidentals.
  - '**Memory Cost:** 0.2 GB

    **Routine Size**: 0.05 GB

    **Storage Cost:**
    1.5 GB


    Increase outgoing damage effect to +18% per stack.'
  - ':// RECORDING 294-C - BEGIN PLAYBACK //:


    "What if we could make bullets
    hurt?"


    "They already do."


    "Okay but... Hurt more?"


    "That''s
    called a higher caliber."


    "I can''t make bullets a higher caliber with
    just code?"


    "And you expect to make them hurt more with just code?"


    "I
    mean... I could always just increase the Frame''s weapon power draw in return
    for higher bullet velocity..."


    There was a long pause, followed by a very
    long sigh. "To think the future of humanity could potentially rest on your shoulders."


    "Only
    if someone else messes us up, first."


    "Yeah. That''ll help me sleep at
    night."


    :// END PLAYBACK //:'
